<title>USA: CHS Electronics Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>CHS Electronics Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except share data)</p>
<p>							Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							    March 31,</p>
<p>						   1997		  1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				 $877,103	    $302,995</p>
<p> Operating income			  14,625		 4,652</p>
<p> Net earnings				 6,690		 1,988</p>
<p>Net earnings per common  share</p>
<p>     Primary				    .44		   .25</p>
<p>     Fully Diluted			    .44		   .24</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 results reflect the negative effect of the strong U.S. dollar.</p>
<p>The company said Q1 1997 results reflect lower costs from its closing of a distribution center in The Netherlands and replacing it with one in Germany.</p>
</text>
